  "rootAssessment": "Lead assents to the exact whole O1-a M3 code unit after independent ACCEPT-UNIT with no required findings. Definition and effective-package law are bound, fixed authenticated boundary passes, typed/private closure and readback/guard corpus, exact audit, reservation/actual async writer/errors/FIFO and ordered immutable freeze/late-producer controls pass. Default82/development85 library, UI25/structural13, process, warnings-denied operability/host/CLI, source113/mint176, catalog5, release and metadata30/termination8/actual start-failure controls support the named M3 behavior. Doctor and allocation-failure ordering remain source/shared-freezer evidence under the prohibited real-installation/owner-injection constraints disclosed to reviewer. No production records before RequestId wiring; no harness or generated-event/sweep authority, no strict timing or product qualification. Product code is present now; separate additive v168 inventory candidate and exact review/five-pin lock bind remain owed. Ordered accepted S-OP-2-P then R then2b binds follow O1-a integration.",
